<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Blessed dispensing in the Divine;</l><l>Eternal blessing uniquely is mine;</l><l>Indwelling law—the Spirit of life—</l><l>Saving me fully to reign in life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Divine dispensing, regular days,</l><l>Always receiving in various ways:</l><l>Eating and drinking—breathing Him in—</l><l>Will constitute me as a God-man.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Intimate living, romance divine,</l><l>Thou, Lord, art mine, and I’m fully Thine!</l><l>Thy counterpart in fellowship sweet,</l><l>Until in marriage union we meet!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
